{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:771cb79e8f5508f1b3314903214b84c910561d2a03cd7f92a18a8415e0d7a869",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fce8c53b053c9f9c1d805653b8f414a39f486b31187fe6d76547324496f8ac87",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●老大！\n辛苦啦。现在有空聊两句不？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c8eaff639f8b6679a0777f22996e55ff278643d2441d618fa98082f68c2cab",
      "text": "写着PV评价的粉丝信，\n多谢你帮俺整理归纳啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74cc94f372408bda93fa00864badb013db91d1f8aae63c7e119ba5392139db1e",
      "text": "全都看完了，开心得不得了，\n回过神来就给老大打电话了。哇哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9142b77471233fb5e927f77be2a2f92575b7e77dd9bcef8cb57a85d61a46f9d9",
      "text": "一方面是看到游戏的乐趣好好传达出去了，\n心里松了口气，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab3d6d81efc454916b754924cbe1e652cf172cc9d199cba4a51c234af4cd0cd6",
      "text": "另一方面，看到大家夸俺和老师他们一起挑战\n最高段位的那部分，俺也好开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae18c8b5b5d04be45cbf05a738b2ff3a4ab47e8a15867a0f370febfa731165ef",
      "text": "看到有感想写“成功时的笑容太棒了”，\n俺又忍不住笑开花啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8822c5da5914c1288e9a74db285d131ae05c63338a12e731de4132551f1d74d",
      "text": "挑战得很有价值呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58801132082d55b345665a51a493921e3d3e65646fcb10fda8b0cebb00606e58",
      "text": "连我都跟着高兴起来了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea92b66d74ba26416e7738030b1520bf222e374bf65e8bf243116323410542f2",
      "text": "嗯。不过能坚持到最后不放弃去挑战，\n也多亏了●●●●●●●●●●老大的加油打气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1f360029fb2968dafb93adf87502a8dfee9edcd45e5879e58c934909e6ee06",
      "text": "那打电话打得太对啦——\n因为俺觉得老大肯定会跟俺一起开心的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03bc37eedecfb036c1da5a042d3229bf3b2210b57dd2f02b9cdf0b447672d5c1",
      "text": "俺们露出了笑容，粉丝们还有各位相关工作人员，\n也都露出了满分的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_309_2_3_042_09_09_a:2_3_042_09_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df93ad119f9e3929cea461b0780b1f3961e1e62fc9e6da94244b7c869cd0b1b3",
      "text": "能把这么棒的工作托付给俺，真打心底谢谢你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
